    <!-- tour -->
    <string name="tour_next">Next</string>
    <string name="tour_finish">Let\'s go!</string>
    <string name="tour_skip">Skip</string>
    <string name="tour1_title">Meet your guide</string>
    <string name="tour1_body">Hello! I am your study buddy. This short tour shows you everything in the app. It takes less than a minute.</string>
    <string name="tour2_title">Lessons in small pieces</string>
    <string name="tour2_body">Your level is split into small units of ten words. Read the word, hear it, then tap the badge to mark it learned. Ten words a day adds up fast.</string>
    <string name="tour3_title">Seven kinds of practice</string>
    <string name="tour3_body">Meanings, English to Urdu, Urdu to English, fill in the blank, idioms, phrasal verbs and a mixed round. The questions are made fresh every time, so they never run out.</string>
    <string name="tour4_title">Five games</string>
    <string name="tour4_body">Word Match, Spelling Bee, Sentence Scramble, the 60 second Speed Round and Odd One Out. Same learning, much more fun.</string>
    <string name="tour5_title">All twelve tenses</string>
    <string name="tour5_body">Each tense has a formula, real examples you can listen to, and its own practice set with a progress bar. Learn it, then prove it.</string>
    <string name="tour6_title">Two ways to say it</string>
    <string name="tour6_body">In Sentences, every Urdu line comes with a simple English version and an advanced one, so you can see how a fluent speaker would say the same thing.</string>
    <string name="tour7_title">Translate anything</string>
    <string name="tour7_body">Type any Urdu or English sentence and get a natural translation, a real explanation and the tense it uses. Add a free AI key in Settings for the best results.</string>
    <string name="tour8_title">Streaks and rewards</string>
    <string name="tour8_body">Open the app daily to build a streak, earn XP, climb ranks and unlock nineteen achievements. Confetti included.</string>
    <string name="tour9_title">Make it yours</string>
    <string name="tour9_body">Settings holds your level, the Urdu toggle, animations, your daily reminder time and the AI key. You can replay this tour any time from there.</string>

